T1  - Short-Term Efficacy of the Artificial Intelligence HeartBot II in Increasing Awareness and Knowledge of Heart Attack in Women: Protocol for a Randomized Controlled Trial With a Waitlist Control
AU  - Fukuoka, Yoshimi
AU  - Kim, Diane Dagyong
AU  - Zhang, Jingwen
AU  - Hoffmann, Thomas J
AU  - Sagae, Kenji
