T1  - The Effectiveness of a Custom AI Chatbot for Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus Health Literacy: Development and Evaluation Study
AU  - Kelly, Anthony
AU  - Noctor, Eoin
AU  - Ryan, Laura
AU  - van de Ven, Pepijn
JO  - Journal of Medical Internet Research
VL  - 27
PY  - 2025
DA  - 2025/01/01/
