T1  - What challenges do developers face in AI agent systems? An empirical study on Stack Overflow & GitHub issues
AU  - Asgari, Ali
AU  - Panichella, Annibale
AU  - Derakhshanfar, Pouria
AU  - Olsthoorn, Mitchell
JO  - Journal of Systems and Software
VL  - 243
